# PSR-8b — Legacy import ratchet

## Intent

Freeze the PSR-8a finding that **new-platform runtime code does not import the
repo-root `legacy/` tree**, and document the Denali **in-package**
`src/types/legacy/` rename plan — **without** deleting `legacy/` or renaming
modules in this wave (rename is a later approved slice).

## Ratchet checks

1. `rg` over `apps/*/src` + `packages/workspace-sdk|platform-core/src` finds **zero**
   imports whose specifier contains repo `legacy/` path segments targeting the
   frozen tree (`from "…/legacy/…"` where path resolves under repo-root `legacy/`).
2. `dependency-cruiser.config.js` still declares `no-legacy-imports` with
   `to.path: "^legacy"`.
3. Denali `packages/workspaces/denali/src/types/legacy/` **still exists** (honest
   debt) and is listed in the rename plan below.
4. No `LICENSE` choice / no `legacy/` archive in this wave.

## Denali rename plan (not executed here)

| Today | Target (future `PSR-8b1`) |
| --- | --- |
| `src/types/legacy/repo-types.ts` | `src/types/denali-repo-types.ts` (or `vendor/`) |
| `src/types/legacy/repo-types-denali.ts` | `src/types/denali-canonical-types.ts` |
| `src/types/legacy/shared-contracts.ts` | `src/types/denali-shared-contracts.ts` |
| `src/types/legacy/denali-*.ts` | `src/types/denali-*.ts` |

Rules for `PSR-8b1`:

- Doc-first note before mass move
- Keep public export stability via `internal.ts` re-exports
- Do not touch repo-root `legacy/` in the same PR

## Smoke

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-8b-legacy-import-ratchet-smoke.mjs
```

